# needs-native-review: the Start the Game vote of a village already issuing, 28 Nov 2026
#. placeholder {tokens}: what the village calls its tokens together
#. placeholder {issuingDay}: the day issuance began, in the reader's date format
#: client/src/components/launch/StartTheGame.tsx
msgctxt "StartTheGame, a village already issuing"
msgid "This village has been issuing {tokens} since {issuingDay}, and that does not restart. The day this vote carries is the Game's birthday, and Moon 1 is the moon it falls in."
msgstr "Esta aldea emite {tokens} desde el {issuingDay}, y eso no se reinicia. El día en que esta votación se apruebe es el cumpleaños del Juego, y la Luna 1 es la luna en la que cae."

