# needs-native-review: the Start the Game vote of a village already issuing, 28 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/JourneyToLaunch.tsx
msgctxt "JourneyToLaunch, confirm before opening the launch vote of a village already issuing"
msgid "Open the vote on starting the Game? Issuance is already open and does not restart: the day this carries is the Game's birthday. It carries the moment enough of its roll have said yes, unless somebody on it has said no."
msgstr "¿Abrir la votación para iniciar el Juego? La emisión ya está abierta y no se reinicia: el día en que se apruebe es el cumpleaños del Juego. Se aprueba en el momento en que suficientes personas de su padrón hayan dicho que sí, salvo que alguna haya dicho que no."
